WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.038
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:04.038 --> 00:00:05.688
Building Privileged Access.

3
00:00:05.688 --> 00:00:09.101
This is Chapter 1: privileged
inventory as code.

4
00:00:09.101 --> 00:00:14.205
You can't make privilege just-in-time until
you can list it: who holds which role,

5
00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:16.598
at which scope, standing or eligible,

6
00:00:16.598 --> 00:00:19.550
directly or through a
group, and in which tier.

7
00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.780
We'll start from Microsoft's own
samples for listing role assignments,

8
00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:26.187
see what they miss, then build the reader,

9
00:00:26.187 --> 00:00:30.125
the rows and the findings, and finish
with two labs and the dangers.

10
00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:35.330
One note before we begin: the code is
illustrative, tested against fixtures.
